BT /F1 12 Tf 50 750 Td (APEX UNIVERSITY POLICY MANUAL - SECTION 1.0: GENERAL SCHOLARSHIP ELIGIBILITY. Apex University awards annual undergraduate merit scholarships to recognize exceptional academic achievement. To qualify for consideration, all applicants must maintain full-time enrollment status \(minimum 12 credit hours per semester\) and have an active student account in good standing. The baseline GPA requirement across all university-wide merit programs is a minimum cumulative GPA of 3.50 on a 4.00 unweighted grading scale.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
