BT /F1 12 Tf 50 750 Td (APEX UNIVERSITY SCHOLARSHIP RULES - SECTION 2.1: ACADEMIC STANDING AND CLASS YEAR REQUIREMENTS. University Merit Scholarships are reserved for continuing students who have demonstrated sustained collegiate academic performance. Applicants must be of Sophomore standing \(Year 2 or above\), having completed a minimum of 30 earned semester credits at Apex University. First-year students \(Freshmen\) are not eligible for general University Merit Scholarships during their initial academic year, but may qualify for separate High School Entrance Grants.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
