BT /F1 12 Tf 50 750 Td (APEX UNIVERSITY SCHOLARSHIP TIERS - SECTION 3.0: AWARD TIERS AND DEANS LIST. Tier A Merit Honors: Students possessing a cumulative GPA of 3.85 or higher receive an annual stipend of . Tier B Merit Honors: Students possessing a cumulative GPA between 3.50 and 3.84 receive an annual stipend of . Deans Honors List Recognition: Awarded each semester to undergraduate students completing 14 or more graded credit units with a term GPA of 3.75 or higher and zero grades of Incomplete.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
