BT /F1 12 Tf 50 750 Td (APEX UNIVERSITY SCHOLARSHIP RULES - SECTION 4.2: STACKING RESTRICTIONS AND ATHLETIC EXCLUSIONS. University Merit Scholarships CANNOT be combined, stacked, or held concurrently with any active Athletic, Varsity, or Sports Grant stipends. In accordance with university athletic regulatory bylaws, receiving athletic grant funds automatically disqualifies the student from receiving concurrent merit awards. If a student qualifies for both an athletic stipend and a merit scholarship, the student must select one single funding award in writing prior to the registration census date.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
