BT /F1 12 Tf 50 750 Td (APEX UNIVERSITY SCHOLARSHIP RULES - SECTION 5.0: ANNUAL RENEWAL PROCESS. Merit scholarships are renewable for up to three consecutive academic years \(six semesters\). To maintain eligibility for automatic renewal, the recipient must maintain a minimum cumulative GPA of 3.40 throughout the academic year and submit the Annual Scholarship Verification Petition to the Financial Aid Office no later than May 15.) Tj ET
endstream
